# Everything here would otherwise be copied into an image layer, where it stays
# readable forever even if a later layer deletes it.

# Live credentials and real balances.
.env
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
data/
docs/sample-response.json
docs/*historic*.json
docs/BASELINE.local.md

# Rebuilt inside the image; copying host builds risks shipping a stale bundle or
# a native module compiled for the wrong platform.
**/node_modules
**/dist

.git
.github
.claude
design
docs
*.md
